{"resourceIdentifier":"3867","resourceName":"Vega-Hereko Istanbul Waste to Energy Project","description":"In order to develop a municipal solid waste management system that will be environmentally friendly and sustainable, Vega-Hereko Istanbul Waste to Energy Project is being implemented by Vega Hereko Enerji Üretim Sanayi ve Ticaret Anonim Şirketi. The project activity is a methane gas power generating plant with a license capacity of 18.012 MWe. \r\nThe project was commissioned with the generation of electricity from April 3rd, 2021, which is regarded as the project start date. The project's lifetime is 16 years, according to the EMRA Generation License. Also, the facility has a mechanical separation plant with 9,000 tons/day capacity. The sorting facility distributes the waste into organics. The separated organic fraction is taken for controlled anaerobic digestion (biological treatment tanks) together with the organic waste received by the facility. The methane recovered from digestion will be combusted through gas engines and the electricity is fed into the grid. Main objective and aim of the project is to take the separated organic fraction to controlled anaerobic digestion process and recover methane from the organic waste. The methane recovered from digestion is combusted through gas engines and the electricity is fed into the grid. The wastewater is re-used in the digesters, then will be sent to ISTAC wastewater treatment plant near the project area. The project is located in In Karakiraz Village, Sile District, in Istanbul /Turkey. This project adopts a crediting period of 7 years. The expected average annual emission reductions are 320,042 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 2,240,299 tCO2eq emissions reduction throughout its first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":41.142313,"longitude":29.365852},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-10","endExclusive":"2022-12-11","endInclusive":"2022-12-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3867"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"İstanbul Şile District"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"317033"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/04/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 03/04/2021 - 02/04/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76841&IDKEY=j98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d8105963739","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-HEREKO-v4.1_2022-10-24.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-24T12:14:14.873Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76632&IDKEY=jiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq33105675528","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS_Listing Represantation_4(1)_Vega Hereko.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-20T13:15:41.887Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=110949&IDKEY=q8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n152998671","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-HEREKO-